     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Convert 20 meters to centimeters.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"20\\cancel{{{\\text{meters}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{100{\\text{ centimeters}}}}{{1{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{meter}}}}}}} \\right) = 2,000{\\text{ centimeters}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Find the volume of a box.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"V{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}L{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}W \\times H{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\left( {{\\text{20 cm}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\text{2,000 cm}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\text{20 cm}}} \\right){\\text{ }} = 800,000{\\text{ c}}{{\\text{m}}^3}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: Convert the volume of a box into liters.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"800,000\\cancel{{{\\text{cubic centimeters}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{ 1 liter}}}}{{{\\text{ 1,000}}\\cancel{{{\\text{cubic centimeters}}}}}}} \\right) = 800{\\text{ liters}}\"></span></p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 526740,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"12\\,{\\text{mm}} \\times 5\\,{\\text{cm}} \\times 1.7\\,{\\text{cm}}\">12\\,{\\text{mm}} \\times 5\\,{\\text{cm}} \\times 1.7\\,{\\text{cm}}</span><br>\n<span data-math=\"V =\">V =</span> ________ mL",
